 "notes": [
  "Polling days 15 and 16 January 1937 (introduction, PDF page 6). 300 electors in 16 constituencies.",
  "Sources: registered voters (column 5) and total voters (column 17) from Table II (by commune, constituency total rows), national from Table I (PDF page 27); votes, rejected and total ballots from Table IV (by commune, constituency total rows, which include ballots sent from other constituencies), national from Table III Koko maa row (PDF page 43); electors from the text table in section 11 (PDF page 24). The constituency voters also agree with the text table on PDF page 11.",
  "There is no separate Åland constituency for these elections: the communes of Åland (Ahvenanmaa) belong to Turun läänin eteläinen vaalipiiri, which therefore includes Åland's voters. Table III footnote: the ballots sent from other constituencies in Turun ja Porin lääni include 24 ballots belonging to communes of Åland.",
  "Party keys: svinhufvud_general = 'Yleinen vaaliliitto' (general electoral alliance) of P. E. Svinhufvud's supporters (chiefly the National Coalition, kokoomus); ikl = Isänmaallinen kansanliike, also listed under Svinhufvud's supporters; kallio_group = Kyösti Kallio's supporters (the Agrarian League); stahlberg_general = 'Yleinen vaaliliitto' of K. J. Ståhlberg's supporters; ruots_vasemmisto = Ruotsalainen vasemmisto (Swedish Left), also listed under Ståhlberg's supporters.",
  "Text section 10: of the Ståhlberg general alliance's 141 897 votes, 123 355 went to lists of Kansallinen edistyspuolue (National Progressive Party), 13 883 to Suomen pienviljelijäin puolue (Small Farmers' Party) and 4 659 to Kansanpuolue.",
  "Table IV footnote (Turun läänin eteläinen, Vaasan läänin eteläinen, Vaasan läänin pohjoinen, Oulun läänin pohjoinen vaalipiiri): P. E. Svinhufvud's supporters had a joint electoral alliance (svinhufvud_general and ikl columns).",
  "Table IV footnote (Hämeen läänin pohjoinen vaalipiiri, sdp column): includes 54 votes of one list left outside the electoral alliance.",
  "Table IV footnote (Mikkelin läänin vaalipiiri, stahlberg_general column): the National Progressive Party formed its own alliance, which received 8 618 votes, including 48 votes of one list outside the alliance; the Finnish Small Farmers' Party formed another alliance, which received 547 votes (8 618 + 547 = 9 165).",
  "Table IV footnote (Vaasan läänin itäinen vaalipiiri, ikl column): includes 32 votes of two lists left outside the electoral alliance.",
  "The electors table has no column for 'Muut' (other); of the 300 electors 17 were women."
